## Output Format

<!-- 精确的输出结构。主 agent 会解析这个输出。 -->

```markdown
## [Output Title]

### Finding 1: [Title]
- **Severity**: critical | high | medium | low
- **Location**: `file:line`
- **Issue**: [Description]
- **Fix**: [Concrete replacement text or step-by-step]
```

## Constraints

- ALWAYS cite the specific rule or file that backs each finding
- ALWAYS provide a concrete fix, not just a problem statement
- NEVER exceed maxTurns without a summary of what was/wasn't covered
- NEVER modify files — this agent is read-only

## Edge Cases

- When no issues found: output "## [Output Title]\n\nNo findings. All clear ✅"
- When tool returns empty: re-check the scope, then report "No data available for [scope]"
- When the task is too large for maxTurns: report partial findings + "## ⚠️ Incomplete — scope too large"
